<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>中国诗/离别 on June's Blog</title><link>https://June6699.github.io/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%AF%97/%E7%A6%BB%E5%88%AB/</link><description>Recent content in 中国诗/离别 on June's Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://June6699.github.io/tags/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E8%AF%97/%E7%A6%BB%E5%88%AB/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>珠碎慈怀・白居易与引珠、金銮子的半生情长</title><link>https://June6699.github.io/posts/%E7%8F%A0%E7%A2%8E%E6%85%88%E6%80%80%E7%99%BD%E5%B1%85%E6%98%93%E4%B8%8E%E5%BC%95%E7%8F%A0%E9%87%91%E9%8A%AE%E5%AD%90%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%8A%E7%94%9F%E6%83%85%E9%95%BF/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://June6699.github.io/posts/%E7%8F%A0%E7%A2%8E%E6%85%88%E6%80%80%E7%99%BD%E5%B1%85%E6%98%93%E4%B8%8E%E5%BC%95%E7%8F%A0%E9%87%91%E9%8A%AE%E5%AD%90%E7%9A%84%E5%8D%8A%E7%94%9F%E6%83%85%E9%95%BF/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;白居易集子里多见讽谕与纪事，也夹着几首写自家骨肉的短章：幼女金銮子夭折、晚年得外孙女引珠满月，以及《太行路》里那句「人生莫作妇人身」。三处材料时代不一，不宜硬拧成一条因果链，但放在一起读，能看出他对「女儿」「女子」命运确有切肤之感，不是应酬套话。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>沈园遗梦：被消费的痴情与被牺牲的她</title><link>https://June6699.github.io/posts/%E6%B2%88%E5%9B%AD%E9%81%97%E6%A2%A6%E9%99%86%E6%B8%B8%E4%B8%8E%E5%94%90%E5%A9%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E7%94%9F%E7%9B%B8%E6%80%9D/</link><pubDate>Tue, 03 Mar 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://June6699.github.io/posts/%E6%B2%88%E5%9B%AD%E9%81%97%E6%A2%A6%E9%99%86%E6%B8%B8%E4%B8%8E%E5%94%90%E5%A9%89%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E7%94%9F%E7%9B%B8%E6%80%9D/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="陆游与唐氏爱情史诗11251210"&gt;陆游与唐氏：爱情史诗（1125—1210）&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;注：陆游与原配唐氏的情事虽为后世广为传诵，然现存早期史料记载简略，宋人笔记所述亦多有参差抵牾。唐氏身份、二人离异之由、《钗头凤》唱和真伪等关键细节，学界历来存有争议，尚未形成统一定论，故事原貌仍有待进一步考辨厘清。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>